invariant: INV-48
file: mlkem_poly.c
catches: test/mlkem-builds.sh
reason: mlkem_poly.c, whose noise sampler reads ML-KEM's secret seed,
  includes keccak_avx2.h, the step before a secret stream runs on
  the four-way Keccak, whose lanes reach stack slots no wipe clears.
  The script requires that no source at the root but keccak_avx2.c
  and mlkem_avx2.c include the header or call its entries.

--- old
#include "mlkem_zetas.h"
--- new
#include "mlkem_zetas.h"
#include "keccak_avx2.h"
